,{"id":326},"usage","Usage",[313,329,330],{},"The usage skill gives AI agents comprehensive knowledge about building with Shuo UI. It covers:",[332,333,334,338,341,357,360,363,370],"ul",{},[335,336,337],"li",{},"Installation and CSS setup",[335,339,340],{},"The v-model types, main props, slots and common pitfalls of all 17 components",[335,342,343,344,348,349,352,353,356],{},"Form validation with ",[345,346,347],"code",{},"UForm",", ",[345,350,351],{},"UFormField"," and Valibot, and the shared rules (",[345,354,355],{},"requiredText"," and others)",[335,358,359],{},"The empty-value contract of each component and how to initialize state",[335,361,362],{},"The query card with a result list and server-side pagination",[335,364,365,366,369],{},"The ",[345,367,368],{},"shuoUi"," module options: site-wide defaults, locales and messages, theming",[335,371,372],{},"Display utilities for dates, numbers, phones and months",[313,374,375,376,381],{},"The skill includes additional references that the AI agent loads on demand based on the task, keeping responses focused and context-efficient. When it needs a full props table or more examples, the skill points the agent to the ",[377,378,380],"a",{"href":379},"\u002Fgetting-started\u002Fagents\u002Fllms-txt#markdown-version-of-a-single-page","markdown version"," of the matching docs page.",[383,384,385,386,389],"note",{},"Once installed, you can invoke the skill by typing ",[345,387,388],{},"\u002Fshuo-ui"," in your agent's chat.",[391,392,394],"h3",{"id":393},"skills-cli","Skills CLI",[313,396,365,397,405],{},[377,398,402],{"href":399,"rel":400},"https:\u002F\u002Fskills.sh",[401],"nofollow",[345,403,404],{},"skills"," CLI is the easiest way to install the Shuo UI skill. It supports many agents, including Cursor, Claude Code, Codex, Windsurf and Cline.",[407,408,413],"pre",{"className":409,"code":410,"language":411,"meta":412,"style":412},"language-bash shiki shiki-themes material-theme-lighter material-theme material-theme-palenight","npx skills add k90325248\u002Fshuo-ui\n","bash","",[345,414,415],{"__ignoreMap":412},[416,417,420,424,428,431],"span",{"class":418,"line":419},"line",1,[416,421,423],{"class":422},"sBMFI","npx",[416,425,427],{"class":426},"sfazB"," skills",[416,429,430],{"class":426}," add",[416,432,433],{"class":426}," k90325248\u002Fshuo-ui\n",[313,435,436,437,440],{},"Target specific agents with the ",[345,438,439],{},"--agent"," flag:",[407,442,444],{"className":409,"code":443,"language":411,"meta":412,"style":412},"npx skills add k90325248\u002Fshuo-ui --agent cursor\nnpx skills add k90325248\u002Fshuo-ui --agent claude-code\n",[345,445,446,463],{"__ignoreMap":412},[416,447,448,450,452,454,457,460],{"class":418,"line":419},[416,449,423],{"class":422},[416,451,427],{"class":426},[416,453,430],{"class":426},[416,455,456],{"class":426}," k90325248\u002Fshuo-ui",[416,458,459],{"class":426}," --agent",[416,461,462],{"class":426}," cursor\n",[416,464,466,468,470,472,474,476],{"class":418,"line":465},2,[416,467,423],{"class":422},[416,469,427],{"class":426},[416,471,430],{"class":426},[416,473,456],{"class":426},[416,475,459],{"class":426},[416,477,478],{"class":426}," claude-code\n",[313,480,481],{},"Or install globally so the skill is available across all your projects:",[407,483,485],{"className":409,"code":484,"language":411,"meta":412,"style":412},"npx skills add k90325248\u002Fshuo-ui --global\n",[345,486,487],{"__ignoreMap":412},[416,488,489,491,493,495,497],{"class":418,"line":419},[416,490,423],{"class":422},[416,492,427],{"class":426},[416,494,430],{"class":426},[416,496,456],{"class":426},[416,498,499],{"class":426}," --global\n",[313,501,502],{},"If cloning from GitHub is slow on your network, you can install directly from the docs site instead:",[407,504,506],{"className":409,"code":505,"language":411,"meta":412,"style":412},"npx skills add https:\u002F\u002Fk90325248.github.io\u002Fshuo-ui\n",[345,507,508],{"__ignoreMap":412},[416,509,510,512,514,516],{"class":418